@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy";
}

<h1 class="h3 mb-3">Privacy</h1>

<p>
    This application stores account details, profiles and course records in a PostgreSQL
    database that you control. Nothing is sent anywhere else.
</p>

<p class="text-secondary small">
    Passwords are never stored in plain text — only a PBKDF2 hash produced by
    <code>PasswordHasher&lt;User&gt;</code> is written to the <code>users</code> table.
</p>

<p class="text-secondary small mb-0">
    Signing in sets one cookie, which identifies your account for the length of the
    session and nothing else. It is not used for tracking, and signing out discards it.
</p>
